{% extends 'dash/common/_turbo_offcanvas_end.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Last update{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <p>
        The notice you see isn't about when the page was last refreshed, but about when we last received data from you.
        <br>If Live View is enabled, it's probably the same (+/- 2s).
    </p>
    <p>In other words, it shows how fresh the data you're seeing is.</p>
{% endblock %}
